                                                                                                        "type": 2,
                                                                                                      },
                                                                                                      {
                                                                                                        "id": 20398,
                                                                                                        "rootId": 18508,
                                                                                                        "textContent": ". Both results have the exact same values, so it seems like the query response is returning multiple instances of the same event. Should I be doing some additional filtering on the events table to dedupe repeated entries?",
