                                                                                                        "rootId": 18508,
                                                                                                        "textContent": "Wondering if you would consider, for the Persons batch export, using a predefined column order?  Every Persons export table we have (one for each client we support) has a different ordering of the same 6 columns.",
                                                                                                        "type": 3,
                                                                                                      },
                                                                                                    ],
