                                                                                "type": 2,
                                                                              },
                                                                              {
                                                                                "id": 19613,
                                                                                "rootId": 18508,
                                                                                "textContent": " To facilitate sorting through your events, you can use transformations to determine arbitrary logic to label an event (e.g. by setting a ",
